[32m+[m[32m# The provider's API key. Required only when chat.provider=gemini, and with no[m
[32m+[m[32m# committed default for the same reason JWT_SECRET has none: a key in this file[m
[32m+[m[32m# is a key published to everyone who can read the repository. It is read once[m
[32m+[m[32m# into the SDK client at startup and is never logged, stored, returned or sent[m
[32m+[m[32m# anywhere but the provider - the startup line says whether a key is present,[m
