[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m#   gemini-3.8-flash, gemini-3.7-flash    low, medium, high[m
[32m+[m[32m#   gemini-3.6-flash, gemini-3.5-flash    minimal, low, medium, high[m
[32m+[m[32m#   the -flash-lite models                minimal, high[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m# The sets do not overlap, so the model and this setting move together. Measured[m
